Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.41,0:00:02.21,EN,,0,0,0,,But the smile says it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.41,0:00:02.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,但他的笑容已经说明了一切
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.35,0:00:06.81,EN,,0,0,0,,After losing his first five Tour-level finals,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.35,0:00:06.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,此前五次巡回赛决赛都失利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.27,0:00:09.35,EN,,0,0,0,,he’s now won two in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.27,0:00:09.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,如今他已连续两次决赛夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.27,0:00:12.97,EN,,0,0,0,,And this one came having not played a match
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.27,0:00:12.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,而这次夺冠之前 他已有
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.97,0:00:14.57,EN,,0,0,0,,for two and a half months.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.97,0:00:14.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,两个半月没有参加比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.83,0:00:17.45,EN,,0,0,0,,What a week it has been for the Spaniard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.83,0:00:17.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,对他来说 这是难忘的一周
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.59,0:00:19.77,EN,,0,0,0,,He is the champion in Chengdu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.59,0:00:19.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,他就是成都站的冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.59,0:00:29.73,EN,,0,0,0,,Just an absolute incredible effort
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.59,0:00:29.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,这样的表现实在不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.73,0:00:31.67,EN,,0,0,0,,and he absolutely deserved that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.73,0:00:31.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个冠军他当之无愧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.89,0:00:33.61,EN,,0,0,0,,He played so well from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.89,0:00:33.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,从一开始 他就打得非常出色
